Subject: [PATCHv4 5/7] arm64: dts: stratix10: add fpga manager and region
Date: Fri,  4 May 2018 09:21:35 -0500
Message-Id: <1525443697-31009-6-git-send-email-richard.gong@linux.intel.com>
